WEBVTT

00:20:59.121 --> 00:21:04.184
but when every three to six months
the business is fundamentally different

00:21:04.208 --> 00:21:05.382
and the scale

00:21:05.406 --> 00:21:06.943
and infrastructure is different,

00:21:06.967 --> 00:21:08.934
those things can start to be of an issue,

00:21:08.958 --> 00:21:12.445
because you start to have
these cohorts of culture,

00:21:12.469 --> 00:21:14.882
especially when you're onboarding
a lot of people,

00:21:14.906 --> 00:21:17.660
you've got the folks
that have been there for five years,

00:21:17.684 --> 00:21:19.351
five and a half years, four years,

00:21:19.375 --> 00:21:20.756
and they've got the snapshot

00:21:20.780 --> 00:21:23.126
of what the most current
version was at that time.

00:21:23.562 --> 00:21:27.824
And it becomes, like, cemented in,

00:21:27.848 --> 00:21:31.186
and so you find yourself
with people debating